        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat: generic session discussion seam with Control UI panel",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nTeams running OpenClaw want a per-session discussion space — humans talking *about* a session, next to it — without core learning about any specific chat product. There is currently no seam for a plugin to bind an external discussion surface to a session, and no Control UI affordance to show one.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nAdds a generic, plugin-agnostic seam and its UI:\n\n- **Plugin SDK**: `openclaw/plugin-sdk/session-discussion` exposes `registerSessionDiscussionProvider` with a minimal provider contract (`info`/`open` returning `{state: none|available|open, embedUrl?, openUrl?}`); a process-wide single-slot registry (global-symbol backed so the SDK entrypoint and lazy gateway chunks share one slot).\n- **Gateway**: additive `session.discussion.info` (read) / `session.discussion.open` (write) methods with TypeBox schemas + compiled validators; provider results are runtime-validated (malformed → UNAVAILABLE error), missing/throwing providers degrade to `{state:\"none\"}`.\n- **Control UI**: a Discussion toggle in the chat pane header (advertisement- and scope-gated) opening a detail-panel rail that renders \"Open discussion\" for `available` and a full-height sandboxed iframe (+external-link) for `open`. The iframe sandbox includes `allow-same-origin` — without it the discussion app's session cookie is never sent and the embed is stuck on its sign-in card; embed URLs are restricted to http(s).\n\nThe concrete ClickClack provider lands separately on top of this seam.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo behavior change until a plugin registers a provider; then each session gets an on-demand, embedded team-discussion rail in the Control UI.\n\n## Evidence\n\nLive end-to-end against a local ClickClack instance serving its new `/embed/channel` view (CSP `frame-ancestors` allowing the Control UI origin):\n\n| Available state | Open state (real embedded channel) |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![available](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/steipete/openclaw-pr-assets/main/clickclack-embed-thread/ocb-available.png) | ![open](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/steipete/openclaw-pr-assets/main/clickclack-embed-thread/ocb-open.png) |\n\nVitest: registry, schema validation, gateway handler (10/10), panel (4/4, incl. cookie-capable sandbox), chat-sidebar (13/13 combined focused run). `check-changed` full lanes exit 0 (typecheck, i18n, formatting, SDK surface/inventory, lint shards, import cycles). Plugin SDK surface gate green.\n",
